  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Norec project is named Action for Youth Empowerment and Sustainable Environment (AYESE) project empowers and educates young people to take lead in local action to deal with global issues. Essentially the main focus in the program is on environment, climate change, young women empowerment and human rights. The program will also equip the participants with leadership and organisational management skills. Countries:  Malawi and Norway</narrative>
  </description>
